sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Client
  participant AuthAPI as Auth API
  participant JWT as JWT Utility
  participant Mongo as RefreshToken MongoDB

  rect rgb(235, 248, 255)
    note over Client,Mongo: Normal refresh rotation
    Client->>AuthAPI: POST /api/v1/auth/refresh-token with refreshToken_1
    AuthAPI->>JWT: verifyRefreshToken(refreshToken_1)
    JWT-->>AuthAPI: userId
    AuthAPI->>Mongo: Find active digest(refreshToken_1)
    Mongo-->>AuthAPI: active token family F
    AuthAPI->>JWT: signRefreshToken(userId)
    JWT-->>AuthAPI: refreshToken_2
    AuthAPI->>Mongo: Transaction: revoke token_1, create active token_2 in F
    Mongo-->>AuthAPI: committed
    AuthAPI->>JWT: signAccessToken(userId, tokenVersion)
    JWT-->>AuthAPI: accessToken_2
    AuthAPI-->>Client: 200 + accessToken_2 + Set-Cookie refreshToken_2
  end

  rect rgb(255, 250, 235)
    note over Client,Mongo: Duplicate previous token inside grace
    Client->>AuthAPI: POST /api/v1/auth/refresh-token with refreshToken_1
    AuthAPI->>JWT: verifyRefreshToken(refreshToken_1)
    JWT-->>AuthAPI: userId
    AuthAPI->>Mongo: Find revoked digest(refreshToken_1)
    Mongo-->>AuthAPI: token_1 replacedBy token_2, grace still valid
    AuthAPI->>Mongo: Confirm token_2 is current active in family F
    Mongo-->>AuthAPI: token_2 active
    AuthAPI->>JWT: signAccessToken(userId, tokenVersion)
    JWT-->>AuthAPI: accessToken_3
    AuthAPI-->>Client: 200 + accessToken_3 only; no Set-Cookie
  end

  rect rgb(255, 235, 238)
    note over Client,Mongo: Replay outside grace or older token reuse
    Client->>AuthAPI: POST /api/v1/auth/refresh-token with old refresh token
    AuthAPI->>JWT: verifyRefreshToken(old refresh token)
    JWT-->>AuthAPI: userId
    AuthAPI->>Mongo: Find revoked digest(old refresh token)
    Mongo-->>AuthAPI: revoked token in family F, not grace-eligible
    AuthAPI->>Mongo: Revoke all active tokens in family F; mark replay
    Mongo-->>AuthAPI: family revoked
    AuthAPI-->>Client: 401 Unauthorized
  end
